    <string name="ob_start">Let\'s go!</string>
    <string name="ob_1">Hoo! Welcome! I\'m Buhito, your night-watch owl 🦉 I\'ll show you around. First, pick your language.</string>
    <string name="ob_2">This is an alarm app. Tap ＋ to create one: choose the time, the days and a name.</string>
    <string name="ob_3">Make it yours: use a system tone, your own audio or even your own voice. Add a category, a sequence of rings or let the phone read the label aloud.</string>
    <string name="ob_4">To stop an alarm you can hold the button for two seconds, or scan your Buhito QR code. Save and print it from Settings.</string>
    <string name="ob_5">For alarms to ring on your lock screen, allow notifications, alarms and full-screen alerts. I\'ll remind you if something is missing.</string>
    <string name="ob_6">Besides alarms, I log your sleep automatically 🌙 and my friend the cat times your stopwatches 🐱</string>
    <string name="ob_7">That\'s it! Ready to create your first alarm?</string>
    <string name="qr_strict_title">Strict mode</string>
    <string name="qr_strict_hint">Alarms with QR can only be switched off by scanning it: no snooze and no other button. Make sure you keep your QR printed or at hand.</string>
